    config WENDY_NET_TEST_REFRESH_SECONDS
        int "Integration test: signed-time renewal interval (seconds)"
        depends on WENDY_NET_TEST_DIAGNOSTICS
        range 30 240
        default 240
        help
            Shorten only the renewal schedule for repeatable endurance and
            crash diagnosis. The original300second proof validity and
